Title: How Japan’s newest yen note came from the Nepali mountains
URL: https://edition.cnn.com/2024/07/02/business/japan-yen-note-nepal-paperbush-intl-hnk
Content: # How Japan’s newest yen note came from the Nepali mountains

Video 
\- Source:

Video 

\- Source:

Video 

\- Source:

Video 

\- Source:

Video 

\- Source:

Video 

\- Source:

Video 

