Content: # A trucker found a 1-year-old boy alive on a Louisiana roadside after the child was abandoned amid storm Beryl, police say

—

A truck driver found a 1-year-old alive in a ditch off an interstate highway in Louisiana this week, a day after the boy’s 4-ye

**********Extracted claims**********

A 1-year-old child was found alive in a ditch off an interstate highway in Louisiana.
A truck driver discovered the 1-year-old child.
The discovery of the 1-year-old child occurred a day after his 4-year-old brother was found dead near the same freeway.
Investigators believe the children were abandoned around the time tropical storm conditions affected the area.
The mother of the two boys has been arrested in Mississippi.
The mother faces charges including murder.
The mother is accused of abandoning her children in Louisiana.
A Louisiana sheriff stated his belief that the 1-year-old child spent two days along Interstate 10.
