Content: # Facing difficult frontline reality and the prospect of Trump in the White House, Zelensky hints at negotiations with Russia

Video 
\- Source:
—

Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky struck an unusually subdued tone as he addressed his nation this wee

**********Extracted claims**********

Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky has hinted at a willingness to negotiate with Russia.
